  "english": [
    "from the following <i>baraita</i>: With regard to <b>one who sends a barrel of wine in the hands of a Samaritan, or</b> a barrel <b>of</b> fish <b>brine or</b> a barrel <b>of fish stew in the hands of a gentile, if he recognizes his seal and his</b> manner of <b>closing</b> the barrel, it <b>is permitted; if</b> he does <b>not</b> recognize them, it <b>is prohibited.</b> Apparently, a sealed barrel is permitted only when it is recognizable.",
    "<b>Rabbi Zeira said</b> that this is <b>not difficult. Here,</b> the first <i>baraita</i> is referring to barrels located <b>in a city; there,</b> the second <i>baraita</i> is referring to barrels that the Samaritan carries <b>on the road.</b> Sealed barrels are permitted in a city because the Samaritan is careful to ensure that gentiles do not touch them in front of anyone, so that he does not forfeit the business of Jews. While traveling he is not concerned, as he assumes that no one will discover that the gentile came into contact with the wine.",
    "<b>Rabbi Yirmeya objects to this: Didn’t these</b> barrels located <b>in the city come by the road</b> as well? <b>Rather, Rabbi Yirmeya says: We learned</b> the <i>baraita</i> that permits sealed barrels only in reference to those that are located <b>between the winepresses. Since everyone is found</b> there, the Samaritan <b>is apprehensive,</b> as he <b>says</b> to himself: <b>Now, if</b> someone <b>sees me</b> allowing a gentile to handle the wine <b>they will cause me to lose</b> my profit, as Jews will not purchase it.",
    "<b>It was stated: For what</b> reason did the Sages <b>prohibit the beer of gentiles? Rami bar Ḥama says</b> that <b>Rabbi Yitzḥak says:</b> It is <b>due to</b> the concern that Jews will befriend gentiles while drinking with them, which might lead to <b>marriage</b> with gentiles. <b>Rav Naḥman said:</b> It is <b>due to</b> the concern of <b>exposure.</b>",
    "The Gemara asks: <b>With regard to what</b> form <b>of exposure</b> is there a concern? <b>If we say</b> that the concern is with regard to <b>exposure of the vat, we too expose</b> the vat, and there is no reason to prohibit gentiles’ beer more than that of Jews. <b>And</b> if you say: <b>Rather,</b> the concern is for exposure <b>of</b> the <b>barrel, we also expose</b> barrels. The Gemara answers: <b>No,</b> it is <b>necessary</b> to prohibit the beer <b>in a place where the water</b> used to brew it is allowed to <b>settle.</b>",
    "The Gemara asks: <b>If that is so, aged</b> beer should <b>be permitted, as Rabbi</b> Yehuda HaNasi <b>says:</b> A substance that might contain exposed water but has <b>aged</b> is <b>permitted,</b> since the poison <b>does not allow it to age,</b> as it goes bad before it grows old. Similarly, if it <b>soured</b> it is <b>permitted,</b> because the poison impairs the taste but <b>does not allow it to sour.</b> Why, then, is all beer prohibited? The Gemara answers: The Sages issued a rabbinic <b>decree</b> with regard to <b>aged</b> beer <b>due to</b> the concern with regard to <b>new</b> beer.",
    "§ The Gemara cites the opinions of various Sages with regard to beer. <b>Rav Pappa</b> had them <b>bring out</b> the <b>beer</b> belonging to gentiles from the store <b>to the entrance of the store, and he</b> would <b>drink</b> it outside the store. <b>Rav Aḥai</b> had them <b>bring</b> the beer <b>to his house, and he</b> would <b>drink</b> it there. <b>And both</b> of them drank the beer away from the presence of gentiles <b>due to</b> concern about <b>marriage</b> with gentiles. The Gemara notes that <b>Rav Aḥai established an extreme preventive measure</b> for himself beyond what is required by <i>halakha</i>.",
    "The Gemara relates that <b>Rav Shmuel bar Bisna happened</b> to come <b>to Marguan,</b> and <b>they brought him wine but he did not drink</b> it. Next <b>they brought him beer but he did not drink</b> it. The Gemara asks: <b>Granted,</b> he did not drink the <b>wine due to</b> the <b>trace [<i>shimtza</i>]</b> of libations, but <b>due to what</b> reason did he refrain from drinking <b>beer?</b> It was <b>due to</b> concern for <b>the trace of a trace,</b> i.e., he did not drink beer due to concern about drinking wine.",
    "<b>Rav says: This Aramean beer is permitted, but my son Ḥiyya does not drink from it.</b> The Gemara asks: <b>Whichever</b> way <b>you</b> look at this matter, Rav’s statement is difficult: <b>If</b> the beer is <b>permitted,</b> then it is <b>permitted to everyone,</b> and there is no reason for his son to refrain from drinking it. And <b>if</b> it is <b>prohibited,</b> it is <b>prohibited to everyone,</b> and why would Rav say it is permitted?",
    "The Gemara explains: <b>Rather, Rav holds</b> that the prohibition is <b>due to exposure, but the bitterness of the hops</b> in the beer <b>goes and impairs the</b> snake’s <b>venom,</b> so that it is safe for an average person to drink. <b>But</b> a person of <b>weak</b> constitution <b>is weakened further</b> by the impaired venom, <b>and</b> Rav was saying: In the case of <b>my son Ḥiyya, since he is weak, he does not drink from it.</b>",
    "<b>Shmuel says: All creeping animals possess venom;</b> that <b>of a snake kills,</b> whereas the venom <b>of</b> other <b>creeping animals does not kill. Shmuel said to Ḥiyya bar Rav: Son of a lion! Come and I will say to you a superior matter that your father, Rav, said. This</b> is what <b>your father said: These Arameans</b> are <b>swollen [<i>zukanei</i>] because they drink exposed</b> liquids, <b>but they did not die</b> from doing so <b>since they eat repugnant creatures and creeping animals,</b> which <b>heat their bodies</b> and thereby render them less susceptible to the venom.",
    "<b>Rav Yosef says:</b>"
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>הַשּׁוֹלֵחַ חָבִית שֶׁל יַיִן בְּיַד כּוּתִי, וְשֶׁל צִיר",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְשֶׁל מוּרְיָיס בְּיַד גּוֹי, אִם מַכִּיר",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "חוֹתָמוֹ וּסְתָמוֹ — מוּתָּר, אִם לָאו — אָסוּר! <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yehuda HaNasi, sixth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1508\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yehuda HaNasi\" data-name-he=\"רבי יהודה הנשיא\">רַבִּי</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "זֵירָא: לָא קַשְׁיָא — כָּאן בָּעִיר, כָּאן בַּדֶּרֶךְ. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>מַתְקֵיף",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לַהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yirmeya bar Taḥlifa II, third and fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1952\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yirmeya bar Taḥlifa II\" data-name-he=\"רבי ירמיה\">רַבִּי יִרְמְיָה</span>: מִידֵּי הָנָךְ דְּעִיר לָא בְּדֶרֶךְ",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אָתוּ? אֶלָּא אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yirmeya bar Taḥlifa II, third and fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1952\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yirmeya bar Taḥlifa II\" data-name-he=\"רבי ירמיה\">רַבִּי יִרְמְיָה</span>: בֵּין הַגִּיתּוֹת",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שָׁנִינוּ, כֵּיוָן דְּכוּלֵּי עָלְמָא אָפְכִי, מִירְתַת, אֲמַר:",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הַשְׁתָּא אִי חָזוּ לִי מַפְסְדוּ לִי. <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"131\" data-sentence-id=\"3\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אִתְּמַר: מִפְּנֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מָה אָסְרוּ שֵׁכָר שֶׁל גּוֹיִם? <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rami bar Ḥama, third and fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2681\" data-full-name=\"Rami bar Ḥama\" data-name-he=\"רמי בר חמא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-2007\">רָמֵי בַּר</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rami bar Ḥama, third and fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2681\" data-full-name=\"Rami bar Ḥama\" data-name-he=\"רמי בר חמא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-2007\">חָמָא</span> אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yitzḥak bar Nappaḥa II, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1885\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yitzḥak bar Nappaḥa II\" data-name-he=\"רבי יצחק\">רַבִּי יִצְחָק</span>: מִשּׁוּם חַתְנוּת, <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2285\" data-full-name=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov\" data-name-he=\"רב נחמן בר יעקב\">רַב נַחְמָן</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אָמַר: מִשּׁוּם גִּילּוּי. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אַגִּילּוּי דְּמַאי? אִילֵּימָא גִּילּוּי דְּנַזְיָיתָא —",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֲנַן נָמֵי מְגַלֵּינַן! וְאֶלָּא דְּחָבִיתָא — אֲנַן",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "נָמֵי מְגַלֵּינַן! לָא צְרִיכָא, בְּאַתְרָא דִּמְצַלּוּ מַיָּא.",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֶלָּא מֵעַתָּה יָשָׁן תִּשְׁתְּרֵי! דְּאָמַר רַבִּי: יָשָׁן מוּתָּר — אֵין",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מַנִּיחוֹ לְיַישֵּׁן, הֶחְמִיץ מוּתָּר — אֵין מַנִּיחוֹ לְהַחְמִיץ.",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "גְּזֵירָה יָשָׁן אַטּוּ חָדָשׁ. <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"132\" data-sentence-id=\"6\">§</span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"6\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Pappa, fifth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2518\" data-full-name=\"Rav Pappa\" data-name-he=\"רב פפא\">רַב פָּפָּא</span> מַפְּיקִין לֵיהּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "(לאבבא) [אַבָּבָא] דְּחָנוּתָא, וְשָׁתֵי. <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Aḥai, eighth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"255\" data-full-name=\"Rav Aḥai\" data-name-he=\"רב אחאי\">רַב אַחַאי</span> מַיְיתוּ לֵיהּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְבֵיתֵיהּ, וְשָׁתֵי. וְתַרְוַיְיהוּ מִשּׁוּם חַתְנוּת, <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"of Rav, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2578\" data-full-name=\"of Rav\" data-name-he=\"רב\">רַב</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אַחַאי עָבֵיד הַרְחָקָה יַתִּירְתָּא. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"7\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"of Rav, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2578\" data-full-name=\"of Rav\" data-name-he=\"רב\">רַב</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Shmuel II, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2763\" data-full-name=\"Shmuel II\" data-name-he=\"שמואל\">שְׁמוּאֵל</span> בַּר",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "בִּיסְנָא אִיקְּלַע לְמַרְגְּוָאן, אַיְיתוֹ לֵיהּ חַמְרָא וְלָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אִשְׁתִּי, אַיְיתוֹ לֵיהּ שִׁיכְרָא וְלָא אִשְׁתִּי. בִּשְׁלָמָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "חַמְרָא מִשּׁוּם שִׁימְצָא, שִׁיכְרָא מִשּׁוּם מַאי?",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מִשּׁוּם שִׁימְצָא דְּשִׁימְצָא. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"8\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"of Rav, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2578\" data-full-name=\"of Rav\" data-name-he=\"רב\">רַב</span>: הַאי שִׁיכְרָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דַּאֲרַמָּאָה שְׁרֵי, וְחִיָּיא בְּרִי לָא נִישְׁתֵּי מִינֵּיהּ. מָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "נַפְשָׁךְ? אִי שְׁרֵי, לְכוּלֵּי עָלְמָא שְׁרֵי, אִי אֲסִיר,",
      "segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְכוּלֵּי עָלְמָא אֲסִיר! <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"9\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֶלָּא, רַב סָבַר מִשּׁוּם גִּילּוּיָא,",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְאָזֵיל מְרוֹרָא דִּכְשׁוּתָא וְקָלֵי לֵיהּ זִיהֲרֵיהּ, וְדִלְקֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מַלְקֵי לֵיהּ טְפֵי, וְחִיָּיא בְּרִי הוֹאִיל וּלְקֵי לָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "נִישְׁתֵּי מִינֵּיהּ. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"10\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Shmuel II, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2763\" data-full-name=\"Shmuel II\" data-name-he=\"שמואל\">שְׁמוּאֵל</span>: כׇּל הַשְּׁרָצִים",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "יֵשׁ לָהֶן אֶרֶס, שֶׁל נָחָשׁ מֵמִית, שֶׁל שְׁרָצִים",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֵינוֹ מֵמִית. אֲמַר לֵיהּ שְׁמוּאֵל <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥiyya bar Rav Mattana, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1127\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥiyya bar Rav Mattana\" data-name-he=\"חייא בר רב\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-2019\">לְחִיָּיא בַּר</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥiyya bar Rav Mattana, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1127\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥiyya bar Rav Mattana\" data-name-he=\"חייא בר רב\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-2019\">רַב</span>: בַּר אַרְיָא, תָּא וְאֵימָא לָךְ מִילְּתָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מְעַלְּיָיתָא דַּהֲוָה אָמַר רַב אֲבוּךְ, הָכִי אָמַר",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֲבוּךְ: הָנֵי אַרַמָּאֵי זוּקָאנֵי (דַּהֲווֹ שָׁתוּ) [מִשּׁוּם דְּשָׁתוּ]",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "גִּילּוּיָא, (וְלָא מִתוּ) [וְהַאי דְּלָא מָיְיתִי] — אַיְּידֵי דְּאָכְלִי שְׁקָצִים",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וּרְמָשִׂים חֲבִיל גּוּפַיְיהוּ. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"11\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yosef I, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1764\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yosef I\" data-name-he=\"רב יוסף בר חייא\">רַב יוֹסֵף</span>:",
      "segment_ids": [
        11
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rashi": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>חָבִית שֶׁל יַיִן בְּיַד כּוּתִי</b> וכ\"ש ביד עובד כוכבים צריך הכרת חותם ואע\"פ",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דכותי אינו מנסך מיהו לא קפיד אמגע עובד כוכבים: <b>וְשֶׁל צִיר <span class=\"dh-divergent\">ומורייס</span></b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>בְּיַד <span class=\"dh-divergent\">עובד</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">כוכבים</span>.</b> צריך הכרת חותם. ציר אע\"ג דלאו אורחא למירמי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ביה חמרא דדמי היין יקרים משל ציר מיהו חיישינן דלמא מחליף ליה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בציר של דגים טמאים ומורייס חיישי'",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "איידי דדמי מורייס יקרים מדמי יין",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דלמא שקיל מורייס ומעייל חמרא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ומערב בי' אבל כותי לא חשיד לאחלופי.",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ציר מזיעה וזיבות של דגים כשכובשין",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אותן במכבש כדאמרינן במועד קטן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "(<a href=\"/avodah_zarah/11a\">דף יא.</a>) ונעשה חזק כחומץ ומטבל",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בו. מורייס מערבין בו קרבי דגים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כדאמרינן לקמן בפרקין (<a href=\"/avodah_zarah/34b\">עבודה זרה דף לד:</a>)",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דנפיש שומניה: <b>מַכִּיר חוֹתָמוֹ וּסְתָמוֹ</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:1:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שלא זייף סתימתו: <b>בָּעִיר.</b> קפיד",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כותי דסבר השתא נגע עובד כוכבים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בייני ולא זבני מייני: <b>לָא בְּדֶרֶךְ אָתוּ.</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וליחוש שמא נגע בהן בבואם בדרך:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>בֵּין הַגִּיתּוֹת <span class=\"dh-divergent\">שנו</span></b> הך דקתני סתומות",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מותרות: <b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">דכ&quot;ע</span> אָפְכִי</b> מצויין בדרכים:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:3:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>מִשּׁוּם חַתְנוּת.</b> שלא ירגיל לעשות",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "משתאות אצל עובד כוכבים ויתן עיניו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בבתו: <b>דְּנַזְיָיתָא</b> בעוד שהשכר",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:5:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בגיגית שהיא נעשית: <b>אֲנַן נָמֵי מְגַלֵּינַן.</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:5:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דקיי\"ל דשיכרא לא שתי חיויא מיניה:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:5:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>בְּאַתְרָא דִּמְצַלּוּ מַיָּא.</b> במקום שרגילין",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:5:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "להשהות המים בכלי עד שיהו צלולים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:5:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ומים יש בהן משום גילוי: <b>יָשָׁן מוּתָּר.</b> כל",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דבר גילוי שהשהו אותו עד שנתיישן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מותר דאין מניחו ארס של נחש ליישן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אם היה בתוכו: <b>הֶחְמִיץ מוּתָּר.</b> יין מגתו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "חדש שנתגלה עד שלא החמיץ והחמיץ",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מותר בידוע שלא שתה בו נחש דאילו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שתה בו נחש לא היה מניחו להחמיץ:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>לְמַרְגְּוָאן.</b> ישראל חשודין היו ולא היו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מקפידין על יינם של עובדי כוכבים:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>מִשּׁוּם שִׁימְצָא</b> חשד יין נסך: <b>שימצא</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:8:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>דְּשִׁימְצָא</b> גזרה שיכרא אטו חמרא:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:8:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>מִשּׁוּם גִּילּוּיָא</b> ומיהו לכו\"ע שרי שאינן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "חולין והאי זיהרא לא מלקי להו: <b>מִשּׁוּם</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">דאזל</span> מְרוֹרָא דִּכְשׁוּתָא.</b> טעם מרירות",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "של כשות וקלי ליה לזיהרא ואין בו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כח להלקות אדם בריא: <b>וְדִלְקֵי</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:4",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>מַלְקֵי לֵיהּ.</b> אדם שהוא חולה קודם",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:4",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לכן ושותהו מזיקו ומכביד חליו:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 31b:10:4",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>מלקי.</b> מזיק: <b>זוקאני.</b> נפוחים:"
    }
  ],
  "vilna_piskaot": [],
  "steinsaltz_sugyot": [
    {
      "id": 131,
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "line_number": 8,
      "label": "א"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "sentence_id": 6,
